- make test, make lint and make eval pass; property tests run 10,000 cases per property.
- Eval: >= 95% first-pass valid ops, 100% valid after retries, zero unrelated diffs on locked lines.
- Chaos: LLM down, Redis down, worker killed mid-job, slow DB: app stays usable in degraded mode per Section 11.
- Lighthouse mobile: performance >= 90, accessibility >= 95. axe: zero serious violations.
- Demo script (Section 15) passes end to end in Playwright at desktop and 360px.

FINAL OUTPUT
Report: how to run locally and deploy, env vars, eval numbers, chaos results, known limitations, next steps. Be terse.
